From 82ca467a7acaec21cb01024699c2cbf00d17040c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: elara <elara@local>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 19:16:02 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] brand: PortalVPN identity, io.portal.xfc, new app icon
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- setup.dart: _appName PortalVPN, _bundleId io.portal.xfc (+ pre suffix, windows data dirs)
- macOS: PRODUCT_NAME/APP_DISPLAY_NAME PortalVPN, bundle id io.portal.xfc, RunnerTests,
  and the build-phase guard that compares DART_DEFINES against the bundle id
- Android: applicationId io.portal.xfc (namespace stays com.follow.clashx — it names the
  Kotlin packages and the MethodChannels Dart talks to; renaming it would break both)
- strings: app_name and service channel PortalVPN
- app icon regenerated from the chosen artwork for macOS/Android/Windows
- tests updated for the new identity
